  (text "U8: factory-default standalone5V sink; CC1DB/CC2DB connected. No PD and no Nano firmware needed.\nU10 enables U11 only when attached AND source advertises1.5A or3A. Default-current sources are rejected.\nU9 powers gate logic separately. U8 internal regulator pins are DECOUPLING ONLY."
